    <!-- ============ Help / FAQ ============ -->
    <string name="help_title">Help / FAQ</string>
    <string name="help_q1">Does Phone Doctor send my data anywhere?</string>
    <string name="help_a1">No. All diagnostics run locally on your device. Nothing is uploaded to a Phone Doctor server.</string>
    <string name="help_q2">Why is a permission being requested?</string>
    <string name="help_a2">Each permission is requested only when you open the matching test (for example, Camera for the Camera Test) and is never requested up front.</string>
    <string name="help_q3">Some information says "Not available on this device". Why?</string>
    <string name="help_a3">Some manufacturers or Android versions do not expose certain hardware details through public APIs. Phone Doctor never guesses or fakes this data.</string>
    <string name="help_q4">How is the Health Score calculated?</string>
    <string name="help_a4">The score combines the results of every completed test category. Categories that could not run are excluded rather than counted as failures.</string>
